			<string>A glass capsule that hugs the notch and expands below it. The notch is a physical cutout — those pixels do not exist and no tweak can light them up — so Halo recreates the presentation around it rather than pretending the cutout itself changes shape. On devices that already have a real Dynamic Island, Halo stays inert.</string>
